would also be nice to configure nethack to use different directories for
bones and saves, though one could also tell zip to zip all *.bon and
*.sav). I would do this because I believe ZIP is quite slow when updating
/ deleting files from an archive, especially if you do it on floppy, even
if you would use RAM drive for temporary space (though don't quote me on
this).

On the second hand, I wouldn't use floppies at all, because they are so
unreliable. 

